  "description": {
   "en": "Collections, in no particular order, of super short comics posted by author Hamita on Twitter/X and pixiv. The short story collections mainly include romcom and boy meets girl, but also include various genres such as scifi, gag, and suspense.\n\n## Volume 1\n1. An Imperfect Woman\n2. Different Kind Of Different Kind\n3. My Girlfriend Isn't Cute\n4. Image Frequency\n5. A Salesman Who Sells Greed\n6. Maid Makeshift\n7. A Goddess Without Inconvenience\n8. One-Night-Only Passingman\n9. Overhumankind's Planet\n\n## Volume 2\n10. Persistent Sports Girl\n11. Misdelivered Love Letter\n12. The Person Who Filled My Heart\n13. A Beauty Soft And Fluffy In All Directions\n14. The Apathetic Maid's Mismanagement\n15. A Cold Senior And Warm Junior\n16. The Ideal Cool Girl Who Is Only Kind To Herself\n17. Duplicity And A Laughingstock\n18. Robot And Landscape Painting\n\n## Volume 3\n19. The Soft-Spoken Conveni Clerk\n20. A Girl Who Grasped A Secret\n21. A Girlfriend Who Wants To Make Meals\n22. I Want To Quit Being A Demon\n23. A Bad Girl's Bag Inspection\n24. Otherworldly Civilization\n25. I Like Beauties Even With Bad Personalities\n26. Counselor\n27. The Transfer Student Ranked First In The Year\n28. A Literature Girl Who's Kind To Geeks But Strict Only With Me"
  },
